!
**DIRAC
.TITLE
Magnesium atom. Spin-orbit fockspace test calculations.
.WAVE F
.4INDEX
**HAMILTONIAN
.INTFLG 
1 1 0
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.RELCCSD
# for pure RELCCSD step the input must contain SCF occupations
*SCF
.EVCCNV
1.0E-10 1.0E-7
.CNVINT
0.01 0.0001
.CLOSED SHELL
4 6
**MOLTRA
.ACTIVE
energy -1000.0 1000.0 1.0
energy -1000.0 1000.0 1.0
*END OF

 &RELCCSD DOFSPC=T DOENER=F IPRNT=1 INTERFACE="DIRAC6" DEBUG=F &END
 &CCFSPC MAXIT=100, NACTH=0,0,0,0, NACTP=8,8,3,3, FSSECT=1,1,0,0,1,0, DOIH=T &END
 &CCIH EPMIN=1.15, EPMAX=1.40  &END

